<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs end down, awaiting new data.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs end down, awaiting new data.</headline>
<text>
<p>1610 GMT - Linear bonds ended quiet day on Monday lower in line with European neighbours, with no reaction to U.S. February NAPM data and little new data seen before Friday. *2007 OLO 5.66% (unch) BE286=, 11 bps over Bunds (15)  MEUR *OLO fut -0.26 at 122.86 BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6320/35 (6315/45) *3-mo bill 3.30/40% (35/45), 1-wk repo 3.52/62 (40/50)  TTFBXL</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
